  "title": "On buckling optimization under uncertain loading combinations",
  "abstract": "This paper proposes a technique to optimize structural components for buckling when the applied loads are partially unknown or unpredictable. As opposed to the traditional buckling optimization situation where the loading configuration is specified, the load ratios are assumed uncertain and are incorporated as variables in the optimization problem formulation. As a result, the optimal designs obtained are insensitive to load variations within an admissible convex set. Additionally, in order to generalize the results and therefore provide a systematic solution procedure, a theorem concerning the shape of the stability boundary of structures whose buckling loads are the solution of linear eigenproblems is stated and proven.",
